+| `--set-plmn` (`--mcc`, `--mnc`) | `register {operator_id}` | no MCC or 0: automatic. uqmid registers at once instead of only storing the preference |
+| `--get-plmn` | modem `get` `operator_code` | the PLMN the modem is registered to (`mcc`, `mnc`), no `mode`: the selection mode is not known |
+| `--network-scan` | `scan` | same keys; `status` is `current_serving`, `available` or `forbidden` |
