+ *  - UQMID_MB_SUPPORTED: SUPPORTED_MODES and SUPPORTED_BANDS, after it,
+ *  - UQMID_MB_CURRENT: CURRENT_MODES and CURRENT_BANDS, after the power state, before the SIM.
+ * @done is called exactly once (maybe from within this call). @err is the message of a fatal error, NULL if it went
+ * well: only the capabilities can fail the initialization (the modem gets the state failed with the failed reason
+ * unknown-capabilities).  Everything that is already loaded is kept (MM: "meant to be loaded only once").
+ */
+enum uqmid_mb_phase {
+	UQMID_MB_CAPABILITIES,
+	UQMID_MB_SUPPORTED,
+	UQMID_MB_CURRENT,
+};
